cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mysterymodel: Opinionated Workflow for Clinical Prediction Models"
abstract: >-
  An orchestration layer for clinical prediction modelling. Established engines
  do the statistics: rms for regression, internal validation, calibration and
  nomograms, the easystats packages for diagnostics and interpretation, and
  tidymodels for resampling and model comparison. The package supplies the
  workflow holding them together and the methodological safeguards that keep a
  published model honest.
